herefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\""}] [{:db/id 17592186432789 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186171933 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b483f9f7-47a9-5725-b1f1-fe0ea39a7e96" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 6"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2a2752c1-636c-52a6-a6d4-6d9b59cbf421" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III only" :db/id 17592186432713} {:answer/id #uuid "4d83589b-d420-59c9-bbed-964e663c6b6d" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id 17592186432720} {:answer/id #uuid "8dac666f-2957-5b5a-bf69-321c0d67de2a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I only" :db/id 17592186432732} {:answer/id #uuid "cd42dba0-3bec-5cb3-9e1f-c94b56e7c76a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id 17592186432751} {:answer/id #uuid "f0877883-a791-5d0e-bd93-e8b6c16fdb44" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I, II, and III" :db/id 17592186432763}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cd42dba0-3bec-5cb3-9e1f-c94b56e7c76a" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id 17592186432751} :answer-field/id #uuid "b3d65056-5e8f-5f44-8d4d-595ca231767e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186432779}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "91c8241d-8043-5a59-abeb-68e020936dc7" :question/math-academy-id "q-132408" :question/problem "Which of the following numbers are divisible by $6?$\n\nI. $345\\,989\\,191$\n\nII. $55\\,355\\,676$\n\nIII. $137\\,252\\,124$" :question/worked-solution "A number is divisible by $6$ if it is divisible by both $2$ and $3.$\n\n- The number $345\\,989\\,191$ is not divisible by $2,$ so it is not divisible by $6.$\n\n- The number $55\\,355\\,676$ is divisible by $2,$ and it is also divisible by $3$ since the sum of its digits is divisible by $3:$\n\n$$\n5+5+3+5+5+6+7+6=42\n$$\n\nSo, $55\\,355\\,676$ is divisible by $6.$\n\n- The number $137\\,252\\,124$ is divisible by $2,$ and it is also divisible by $3$ since the sum of its digits is divisible by $3:$\n\n$$\n1+3+7+2+5+2+1+2+4=27\n$$\n\nSo, $137\\,252\\,124$ is divisible by $6.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\""}] [{:db/id 17592186432790 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186171934 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "cb0ae539-5348-5a2c-b226-c009ce6d6094" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 7"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5c90b2bd-a16e-537c-aa1a-b49d1b1aa9f0" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III only" :db/id 17592186432724} {:answer/id #uuid "69d77dac-58f7-5252-9e21-125e39d4033b" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id 17592186432727} {:answer/id #uuid "a5d0a1e6-9bc7-54e5-adb0-ec9f8743d848" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id 17592186432740} {:answer/id #uuid "b11e3ef3-de26-5e2b-a700-7f2ecb279329" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and II only" :db/id 17592186432744} {:answer/id #uuid "d8eb41db-fc65-5243-aa64-63b69ecf8947" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I only" :db/id 17592186432756}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a5d0a1e6-9bc7-54e5-adb0-ec9f8743d848" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id 17592186432740} :answer-field/id #uuid "cd4c20e9-b428-5717-aa65-b028512ceffa" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186432781}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "951452dc-b5fb-50d7-8d4f-8b1233b43cf0" :question/math-academy-id "q-223369" :question/problem "Which of the following numbers are divisible by $7?$\n\nI. $447$\n\nII. $406$\n\nIII. $847$" :question/worked-solution "To check if a number is divisible by $7,$ double the last digit, subtract the result from the remaining digits, and then check if the difference is divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $447,$ we have that \n\n$$\n44-2(7)=44-14=30\n$$\n\nwhich is not divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $447$ is not divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $406,$ we have that \n\n$$\n40-2(6)=40-12=28\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $406$ is divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $847,$ we have that \n\n$$\n84-2(7)=84-14=70\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $847$ is divisible by $7.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\""}] [{:db/id 17592186432791 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186171933 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b483f9f7-47a9-5725-b1f1-fe0ea39a7e96" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 6"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "03716efb-8dd0-5692-a7ad-ddc54290f97c" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and III only" :db/id 17592186432702} {:answer/id #uuid "c7079a82-b92a-5d2b-9c94-e0b3d56ba29d" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III only" :db/id 17592186432750} {:answer/id #uuid "d53103cc-e21c-5a43-a029-4914bb36a519" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id 17592186432753} {:answer/id #uuid "d86b4192-f97c-51d0-8a92-2939d373fe1c" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I, II, and III" :db/id 17592186432755} {:answer/id #uuid "ecf7965c-4e93-5f39-a663-6a32dce50c9e" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id 17592186432761}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "03716efb-8dd0-5692-a7ad-ddc54290f97c" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and III only" :db/id 17592186432702} :answer-field/id #uuid "008ba33f-0dbe-5e5d-81fc-18953e1cddb8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186432769}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "a49592c2-4649-5980-ab80-d5418f7e763f" :question/math-academy-id "q-85422" :question/problem "Which digits, when inserted into the blank, make the number $114\\,040\\,32◻$ divisible by $6?$\n\nI. $0$\n\nII. $5$\n\nIII. $6$" :question/worked-solution "A number is divisible by $6$ if it is divisible by both $2$ and $3.$ Remember that to determine whether a number is divisible by $3,$ we check whether the sum of the digits is divisible by $3.$\n\nFor the given number, the sum of the digits is\n\n$$\n1+1+4+0+4+0+3+2+◻=15+◻.\n$$\n\nNow, let's consider each of the given digits we can substitute into the blank.\n\n- If we substitute $0$ into the blank, we get $114\\,040\\,320,$ which is divisible by $2.$ The sum of the digits is $15+0=15,$ which is divisible by $3,$ so the number is also divisible by $3.$ Therefore, the number is divisible by $6.$\n\n- If we substitute $5$ into the blank, we get $114\\,040\\,325,$ which is not divisible by $2.$ So, the number is *not* divisible by $6$ either.\n\n- If we substitute $6$ into the blank, we get $114\\,040\\,326,$ which is divisible by $2.$ The sum of the digits is $15+6=21,$ which is divisible by $3,$ so the number is also divisible by $3.$ Therefore, the number is divisible by $6.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\""}] [{:db/id 17592186432793 :knowledge-point/_questio